.Dd September 19, 2026
.Dt BUSYBOX-KLIBC-UTILS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm busybox-klibc-utils ,
.Nm resume
.Nd BusyBox suspend-to-disk restoration tool
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm resume
.Ar BLOCKDEV
.Op Ar OFFSET
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm resume
is the klibc-utils applet of BusyBox 1.36.1 as built for Rach2.
It restores system state from suspend-to-disk data in
.Ar BLOCKDEV .
Rach2 has no swap, so this applet has no use here.
